## Application icon

The application icon puts the satellite emoji in front of the rainbow emoji. Both images come from
Google's Noto Emoji project (https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji, commit
`99701e07d3d1fe1bdbcdb14964547f0fd592966f`, 2026-10-26): `2D/svg/emoji_u1f6f0.svg` (U+1F6F0 satellite)
and `2D/svg/emoji_u1f308.svg` (U+1F308 rainbow). The project licenses these images under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, with this notice:

> Copyright 2013 Google, Inc. All Rights Reserved.

The full text of the Apache License 2.0 appears below, under "Apache License 2.0". qtable changed the
images only by composing them (the satellite scaled to 85 % and centred over the rainbow, with a margin
added) and rasterising the result to the sizes the icon files need. The unmodified sources, the
composed SVG, and the script that rebuilds every icon file from it are in `assets/icon/` in the source
repository; `assets/icon/sources/LICENSE-noto-emoji` is the licence file as the project ships it.

